<title>SPAIN: BBV could approve share split on Friday.</title>
<headline>BBV could approve share split on Friday.</headline>
<dateline>SANTANDER, Spain 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The board of Spanish bank Banco Bilbao Vizcaya could approve on Friday the halving of the nominal value of its shares, which had been previously announced, sources at the bank said.</p>
<p>BBV previously said it would split the shares were they to exceed 10,000 pesetas a share. On Thursday, BBV closed down 250 pesetas a share at 10,090.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
